  "<p>Makholmen labyrinth (Sweden)</p>": "",
  "<p>Painted on a red pillar in Pompeii, before AD 79. It reads: LABYRINTHUS HIC HABITAT MINOTAURUS, “the labyrinth, here lives the Minotaur”.</p>": "",
